# Phase 2: clean URLs for known referral partners only (preview-only,
# not yet wired for production). Each rule uses the "!" force flag so
# it wins even though the matching static <slug>/index.html file still
# physically exists in this deploy - the 21 static pages are
# intentionally left in place as an instant per-slug rollback: remove
# or comment out one pair of lines below and that slug immediately
# falls back to serving its original static page again.
#
# Deliberately NOT a wildcard. Only the slugs listed here are wired -
# any other path (typo, unknown, not-yet-onboarded partner) has no
# matching rule and no matching file, so it falls through to Netlify's
# normal 404 rather than ever reaching the dynamic template.
#
# Root (/) is untouched on purpose - out of scope for this phase.

